<title>GERMANY: Bender reappointed Frankfurt airport chairman.</title>
<headline>Bender reappointed Frankfurt airport chairman.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flughafen Frankfurt Main AG (FAG) said board chairman Wilhelm Bender has been re-appointed by the supervisory board for a further five years.</p>
<p>Bender has been company chairman since January 1, 1993 and was previously managing director of Schenker &amp; Co, Frankfurt.</p>
<p>FAG is the owner and managing authority of Frankfurt Airport. --Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
